[{"id": 494514265, "text": "Example story beginning", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 494514219, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 438, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">Story seed: A talking cat who is terrified of water</span></p>\n<p>On the edge of the village, there lived a small, fluffy cat named Jasper. He had a secret no one knew—he could speak, but there was one thing that terrified him more than anything: water. He refused to go anywhere near the river, even though it was the very thing that kept his village safe…</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">Story seed: A mysterious map found in an attic </span></p>\n<p>But one day, the river stopped flowing. Jasper knew that soon, the Dragon King across the mountains would realise that their last defence had failed, and bring his forces to attack the village. A feeling of terror began to rise in the little cat's chest, until he remembered a mysterious map he had found in the attic. Perhaps it would lead him to the source of the river, and he could make the water start flowing again...</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">Story seed:...</span></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "pF8-OoZFeSsmocVdDLcaD", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 438, "name": "Example story beginning", "logCreatedAt": "2024-11-18T15:06:04.629677", "logUpdatedAt": "2024-11-18T15:07:59.491262", "logCreatedById": 21670528, "logUpdatedById": 21670528, "nameForContentDev": "Story seeds example story"}}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 494512381, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 438, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "XcbfXmyoT2lQxlulIgxH1", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 494515167, "text": "Scraps of paper with writing on - each has one of the examples in the \"setting up\" section above.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "Story seeds blob", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "Story seeds blob-9fFRIRnuY-JPU4WA0EV6X.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 494512381, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "1g0bJOwGTcS-bmVjnEAT6", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 494514370, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 494512381, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><strong>Tip:</strong></p>\n<p>If you have some fantastic ideas to continue the story without choosing a new seed, then go ahead! You don't need to choose a seed every time you swap over.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "fO4fLw5Aq-noX6eRuo7nQ", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 494512574, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 494512381, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>Setting up: Gather story seeds</h2>\n<p>Work together to write down ten (or more) story seeds on small slips of paper.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For example:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A talking cat who is terrified of water</li>\n<li>A mysterious map found in an attic</li>\n<li>A lost prince who has no memory of his past</li>\n<li>A clock that ticks backwards</li>\n<li>A secret door behind a painting</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\"><em>These could be anything that might inspire a story: a character, a setting, an object, or a situation. </em></span><br>&nbsp;</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "ezjlv5GpZbWCE1incx0uG", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 494512766, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 494512381, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Player 1 takes a seed and uses it to start telling a story.</li>\n<li>Player 2 takes a second story seed and uses that to continue the story.</li>\n<li>Keep taking in turns to choose a new story seed and tell more of the story until you get to the end of your story!</li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "WKkwhKAWgkiP9Bz2v73YK", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]